## Fake check

Fake "GTA VI for PC" downloads are spreading malware. Paste a GitHub repository at
[sixonpc.com/check](https://sixonpc.com/check) and the page reads its public record live: whether it is tracked here,
whether it copies a known project's name, its age, whether it ships a download, whether there is real source, its
star pattern and its owner's account. It never calls a repository safe. The strongest thing it says is that nothing
alarming was found.

