## Forum

The forum runs on [GitHub Discussions](https://github.com/Github-Samuel/sixonpc/discussions), so anyone with a
GitHub account can post. The site shows the latest threads. Read the rules in the pinned welcome thread before
posting: no game files, no extracted assets, no prebuilt binaries.

